{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Peter and Online Dating", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Oh I Wish ...", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 11, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Present Perfect Continuous vs Present Perfect Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a past action or an action that began in the past that is connected to the present in some way.  <br/><br/> You use the Present Perfect Continuous tense to describe:  <ul><li>a single activity that lasts a long time, and</li><li>  an action that is repeated over a long period of time.</li></ul> These continue up to the present.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you use the Perfect tense (Present or Continuous), you think about <span class=\"underline\">the past and present together</span>. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To emphasize the <span class=\"underline\">action</span>, you use the Continuous form.  <br> The structure of the Present Perfect Continuous tense is: <span class=\"strong\">subject + have + been + v-ing </span><span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I've been looking for that special someone for a while now.</li><li> I've been reading comics since I was a kid.</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To emphasize the <span class=\"underline\">result </span> of the action, use the Simple form. <br> The structure of the Present Perfect tense is: <span class=\"strong\">subject + has/have + past participle </span><span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>It seems that I have been unlucky so far. </li><li> I've fallen in love before, but I've always been afraid of commitment.</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I've always been fascinated by people who don't betray their true feelings. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I've been checking my profile every day but I haven't found you yet.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fascinated ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "strongly interested in something or someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've always been fascinated by people who love comic books.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use in an online dating profile.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to fall in love", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to have strong romantic feelings for someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've fallen in love with a girl who loves comic books.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "commitment", "type": "name"}, {"content": " being dedicated to something or someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've fallen in love before, but I've been afraid of commitment.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "spellbinding", "type": "name"}, {"content": "capable of captivating someone's attention completely", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm worried that my personality isn't spellbinding enough.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "intimidating", "type": "name"}, {"content": " daunting; makes you feel inferior", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I wish I didn't find serious relationships so intimidating.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to betray", "type": "name"}, 